OL,3,GNEWSARider dies after crash at
OL,4,Amotocross track
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old cyclist died after a
OL,7,Fcrash on a motocross track.
OL,9,FThe rider, from Kent, was seriously
OL,10,Finjured while riding during an open
OL,11,Fsession at Flackwell Heath Moto Park in
OL,12,FHigh Wycombe, Buckinghamshire, at about
OL,13,F10:00 BST on Saturday.
OL,15,FThames Valley Police said he was taken
OL,16,Fto hospital but died on Monday.
OL,18,FNo other riders or vehicles were
OL,19,Fbelieved to have been involved, the
OL,20,Fforce added.
